mammouth mcp

manage MCP (Model Context Protocol) servers

Commands:
  mammouth mcp add [name]     add an MCP server
  mammouth mcp list           list MCP servers and their status                        [aliases: ls]
  mammouth mcp auth [name]    authenticate with an OAuth-enabled MCP server
  mammouth mcp logout [name]  remove OAuth credentials for an MCP server
  mammouth mcp debug <name>   debug OAuth connection for an MCP server

Options:
  -h, --help        show help                                                              [boolean]
  -v, --version     show version number                                                    [boolean]
      --print-logs  print logs to stderr                                                   [boolean]
      --log-level   log level                   [string] [choices: "DEBUG", "INFO", "WARN", "ERROR"]
      --pure        run without external plugins                                           [boolean]
"
`;

