  mammouth debug config        show resolved configuration
  mammouth debug lsp           LSP debugging utilities
  mammouth debug rg            ripgrep debugging utilities
  mammouth debug file          file system debugging utilities
  mammouth debug scrap         list all known projects
  mammouth debug skill         list all available skills
  mammouth debug snapshot      snapshot debugging utilities
  mammouth debug startup       print startup timing
  mammouth debug agent <name>  show agent configuration details
  mammouth debug v2            debug v2 catalog and built-in plugins
  mammouth debug info          show debug information
  mammouth debug paths         show global paths (data, config, cache, state)
  mammouth debug wait          wait indefinitely (for debugging)

